Package: fcitx-vinput-rs
Version: @VINPUT_VERSION@-@VINPUT_RELEASE@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @VINPUT_ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Vinput Maintainers <maintainers@example.invalid>
Homepage: https://github.com/rijuyuezhu/fcitx-vinput-rs
Depends: bash, coreutils, dbus-user-session, fcitx5, libfontconfig1, libglib2.0-bin, libpipewire-0.3-0, libsystemd0, libwayland-client0, libx11-6, libxkbcommon0, procps, systemd, util-linux-extra
Recommends: wireplumber
Provides: fcitx5-vinput
Conflicts: fcitx5-vinput
Replaces: fcitx5-vinput
Description: Rust voice-input addon and daemon for Fcitx 5
 A Rust rewrite of fcitx5-vinput containing the command-line management tool,
 D-Bus daemon, Rust/Iced management GUI, thin Fcitx 5 addon, activation
 metadata, translations, and checksum-pinned private native ASR runtime
 libraries.
